## 四、约束方程

$$\boldsymbol{f} = \begin{bmatrix} f_x \\ f_y \end{bmatrix} = \begin{bmatrix} l_1\cos\phi_1 + l_2\cos\phi_2 - l_5 - l_4\cos\phi_4 - l_3\cos\phi_3 \\ l_1\sin\phi_1 + l_2\sin\phi_2 - l_4\sin\phi_4 - l_3\sin\phi_3 \end{bmatrix} = \boldsymbol{0}$$

---

## 五、雅可比与VMC

| 符号 | 含义 | 维度 | 计算方式 |
|------|------|------|---------|
| $J$ | 末端雅可比矩阵 | $2\times2$ | $J = \frac{\partial C}{\partial q} + \frac{\partial C}{\partial \boldsymbol{\theta}}\frac{d\boldsymbol{\theta}}{d\boldsymbol{q}}$ |
| $\frac{\partial \boldsymbol{f}}{\partial \boldsymbol{q}}$ | 约束对驱动角偏导 | $2\times2$ | `fq = jacobian(f, [phi1;phi4])` |
| $\frac{\partial \boldsymbol{f}}{\partial \boldsymbol{\theta}}$ | 约束对从动角偏导 | $2\times2$ | `fth = jacobian(f, [phi2;phi3])` |
| $\boldsymbol{q}$ | 驱动角向量 | $2\times1$ | $[\phi_1,\ \phi_4]^T$ |
| $\boldsymbol{\theta}$ | 从动角向量 | $2\times1$ | $[\phi_2,\ \phi_3]^T$ |
| $\boldsymbol{F}$ | 末端广义力 | $2\times1$ | $[F_x,\ F_y]^T$，x右y上为正 |
| $\boldsymbol{\tau}$ | 关节力矩向量 | $2\times1$ | $[\tau_1,\ \tau_4]^T$，逆时针为正 |

$$\boldsymbol{\tau} = J^T \boldsymbol{F}$$

**奇异判据**：

$$\det\!\left(\frac{\partial \boldsymbol{f}}{\partial \boldsymbol{\theta}}\right) = l_2 l_3 \sin(\phi_2 - \phi_3) = 0$$

即 $\phi_2 = \phi_3$（两连杆平行）时机构奇异。

